# memory_use_after_free — use-after-free error detection
# (README §14). Tests detecting UAF bugs.

MemoryUseAfterFree is project
MemoryUseAfterFree module examplesMemoryUseAfterFree
MemoryUseAfterFree target console
MemoryUseAfterFree entry main

examplesMemoryUseAfterFree is module
examplesMemoryUseAfterFree path examples.memoryUseAfterFree
examplesMemoryUseAfterFree exports main
examplesMemoryUseAfterFree purpose "Demonstrate use-after-free detection"
examplesMemoryUseAfterFree invariant "UAF errors are prevented"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main memory heap yes
main async no
main purpose "Detect use-after-free errors"
